with username: guest and password: guest

This folder contains our IVP project.
There are 2 subfolders:
	1) endEnclosure:	this software is described in our paper
			"A Novel Approach to the Initial Value Problem
					with a Complete Validated Algorithm",
   			http://arxiv.org/abs/2502.00503.
			Jan 2025 (revised Jan 2026).
	2) endCover:	This software is described in our
			"End Cover for Initial Value Problem:
				Complete Validated Algorithms with Complexity Analysis",
			http://arxiv.org/abs/2602.00162.
			Feb 2026.
You can download the .zip files directly
Please contact us if you for any questions
or help in using this software!

-- Bingwei Zhang and Chee Yap
Feb 2026
